        dcterms:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "alpha sweep (65-85) and beta sweep at alpha = 75 (15-90) are rendered and tabulated (model_regime_table alpha x beta -> k_proj, R, alpha_proj); the self-test checks the monotone effect of beta; --bootstrap is a CLI parameter; trim_ends / sectors / thresholds are data-driven from reference.json. Breadth ratio and handedness are still fixed." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
